<p>Keyword research only matters if it ends in a plan you can actually act on. This service skips the generic keyword-tool export and starts from what your real competitors are already ranking for — the clearest signal of what's actually working in your market.</p>

<h2>What's included</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Competitor gap analysis against 3–5 direct competitors</li>
  <li>Search intent mapping — informational, commercial, or transactional</li>
  <li>Keyword difficulty weighed against realistic opportunity, not just volume</li>
  <li>A content plan mapping each keyword to an existing or new page</li>
</ul>

<p>This is usually the starting point before on-page work or new content — it tells you exactly what to write about, and why.</p>
